't feel real' quote, but no specific sales or view-count impact figures were reported.", "date": "2026-04-29", "source": "L'Officiel Singapore / Billboard", "tier": "T2", "url": "https://www.lofficielsingapore.com/fashion/aespa-ningning-named-gucci-global-brand-ambassador"}, {"name": "Lee Know (Stray Kids)", "act": "singer / K-pop (Stray Kids)", "brand": "Gucci", "role": "global ambassador", "region_focus": "NEA", "what_ko": "스트레이 키즈 리노가 구찌 글로벌 앰버서더로서 서울 매장 리오프닝 행사에 닝닝, 박규영, 제이 박, 이영애 등과 함께 참석해 K팝·K드라마 스타가 총출동한 구찌 행사로 보도됐다.", "what_en": "Stray Kids' Lee Know, as a Gucci global ambassador, joined NINGNING, Park Gyu-young, Jay Park and actress Lee Young-ae at a Seoul store reopening event, covered as a star-studded gathering of K-pop and K-drama ambassadors.", "impact_ko": "보그 코리아 등이 행사 참석자 라인업을 집중 보도했으나 구체적 매출·조회수 수치는 보도되지 않음.", "impact_en": "Vogue Korea and others gave heavy coverage to the event's celebrity lineup, but no specific sales or view-count figures were reported.", "date": "2026-09-19", "source": "WWD / Vogue Korea (via X)", "tier": "T2", "url": "https://wwd.com/fashion-news/fashion-scoops/gucci-stray-kids-member-lee-know-global-brand-ambassador-1237955449/"}, {"name": "Tian Xi Wei", "act": "actress (China)", "brand": "Gucci", "role": "house friend", "region_focus": "NEA", "what_ko": "구찌가 중국 배우 톈시웨이를 최신 브랜드 앰버서더로 발표, 중국 시장 전용 엔터테인먼트 라인업을 보강했다.", "what_en": "Gucci named Chinese actress Tian Xi Wei as its latest brand ambassador, reinforcing its China-facing entertainment roster.", "impact_ko": "중국 겨냥 임명으로 현지 매체 보도가 이어졌으나 구체적 판매·조회수 수치는 보도되지 않음.", "impact_en": "The China-focused appointment drew local trade coverage, but no specific sales or view-count figures were reported.", "date": "2026-09-15", "source": "Retail Boss", "tier": "T3", "url": "https://retailboss.co/gucci-names-tian-xi-wei-brand-ambassador-china/"}, {"name": "Jang Won-young (IVE)", "act": "singer / K-pop (IVE)", "brand": "Dior", "role": "global ambassador", "region_focus": "NEA", "what_ko":